                                            <history>
                                                <summary>BnF EAD catalogue (srcphys_60d1692f7a459e7ce1c257): Genèse, à l&apos;usage des coptes, avec commentaire de Marc ibn Qanbar. Date described in the BnF catalogue: 1596.</summary>
                                                <provenance>
                                                    <note xml:lang="en">Notice by Renaudot. From the Bibliothèque Séguier-Coislin. Wax seal with F. D. cipher.</note>
                                                </provenance>
                                                <origin>
                                                    <origDate calendar="#gregorian" when="1596">1596</origDate>
                                                    <p>Anonymous copy completed on 1 Bāba 1313 of the Martyrs at Darb al-Ṭāḥūn, under the pontificate of Gabriel VIII, from a manuscript copied at the monastery of Saint Anthony on 28 Amšīr 1113 of the Martyrs / 1397 and given as waqf to the monastery of Abū Ḥannis (f. 179).</p>
                                                </origin>
